  "adaptations": [
    "Imported only the game-puzzle local-play template; game-puzzle-merge remains a separate unimported identity",
    "Assets/Template relocated to assets/template, including Godot import cache identities; immutable managed URLs, hashes and bytes retained",
    "Approved ManusCC0 Regular, Medium and Bold retained with the licensed PlushieSansSC CJK fallback and full authoring source",
    "Addon owns preview, export, release and publication; package export targets dist/index.html and guidance is generated from Addon skill-src",
    "Original solo and local split-screen gameplay, localization, art, audio, tools and native tests preserved",
    "Retired Sandbox-only publisher wrapper omitted; further media publication follows the installed Addon asset workflow",
    "Web loader uses embedded approved ManusCC0 and licensed CJK WOFF2 subsets instead of system fonts",
    "Retained source-image import sidecars point to their actual source PNG locations; cold import verification bootstraps Godot fonts before a strict second pass",
    "Addon project metadata, package commands and portable developer tooling are explicitly excluded from playable exports"
  ],
